RK05 Exerciser
<UL>
<LI><b>G502</b> is a drawing of the DEC G502.</LI>
<LI><b>G503</b> is a drawing of the DEC G503.</LI>
<LI><b>TK05ta</b> is a drawing to the DEC test assembly.</LI>
<LI><b>RK05ex</b> is a merge of the various tester parts onto a single board.</LI>
<LI><b>RK05ex6x10</b> is a "shrink" to 6"x10", and with proper switches.</LI>
<LI><b>RK05exNew</b> is a 6"x10" board with hard-to-find chips replaced.</LI>
